  "created": "2026-08-11T22:04:07.27Z",
  "description": "A modern, service- and factory-oriented .NET cryptography library built on BouncyCastle, designed for dependency injection. Provides block ciphers (AES, DES, 3DES, Blowfish, Twofish, Serpent, Camellia, CAST5, IDEA, SEED, ARIA, SM4) with ECB/CBC/CTR/GCM (incl. AAD) modes, stream ciphers (ChaCha20, ChaCha20-RFC7539, Salsa20), RSA (PKCS#1 v1.5 & OAEP encryption, signing, PEM) over a reusable RsaKey handle, post-quantum cryptography (ML-DSA and ML-KEM, each with key PEM import/export and optional PBES2 encryption), X.509 certificates (generation, CSR, issuance, chain validation, CRL revocation, PKCS#12/DER import-export), hashing (MD5, SHA-1, SHA-256, SHA-512, SHA-3), HMAC, CRC checksums (CRC-16 ARC/CCITT-FALSE/XMODEM/MODBUS/KERMIT and CRC-32 ISO-HDLC/CRC-32C, for error detection only), one-time passwords (HOTP/TOTP with otpauth provisioning), key derivation (PBKDF2, Argon2), padding schemes, and data encoding (Base64, Base32, Hex).",
